# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Colophon — what never leaves this machine
#
# Rule: if it can be regenerated from the spec, it is not source.
# `runs/` is the big one — 3 GB of rendered attempts, contact sheets and QA
# transcripts. All of it is reproducible from examples/*/spec.json.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Derived run data (regenerable; never commit) --------------------------
# Leading slashes matter. Without them these would also swallow the
# source package at colophon/runs/, which is very much not derived data.
/runs/
/scratch/
/experiments/
/private/
/local/
/work/

# --- Renderer scratch ------------------------------------------------------
# HyperFrames writes a UUID-named work dir inside each attempt. Covered by
# /runs/ above, but listed explicitly in case anyone renders elsewhere.
colophon-render.mp4
video-only.mp4

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Media (all generated; logo/diagram exceptions re-included below) -------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.pdf
!docs/assets/**/*.png
!docs/assets/**/*.svg

# Blog hero and figures are part of the published blog post, not scratch.
!blog/images/**/*.png
!blog/images/**/*.svg

# --- Node (renderer / tooling) ---------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.npm/
.pnpm-store/

# --- Secrets and credentials -----------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
service-account*.json
.netrc
.token

# --- Test and lint caches ---------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# --- Editors and OS ---------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Local-only notes -------------------------------------------------------
# Anything named this way is working scratch and is never published.
*.local.md
NOTES.local.*
*.private.*
